# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Iron Miles / repo-wide ignores
#
# NOTE: the Iron Miles website itself is plain static HTML/CSS/JS with
# no build step, so its source is committed in full and nothing about
# the live site is ignored here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

